{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/281748-do-hunters-have-to-know-it-s-a-supernatural-to-get-practical-experience","id":281748,"title":"Do hunters have to know it's a supernatural to get practical experience?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-14T18:09:53-07:00","id":281748,"title":"Do hunters have to know it's a supernatural to get practical experience?","content":"Do hunters have to be sure that the thing they were dealing with wasn't human to get practical experience? Could they get experience if they only suspected the thing wasn't human? As a sort of aside, do they get practical experience for mortals, such as slashers or mafia members?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T04:00:30-07:00","id":287432,"title":"","content":"My assumption is that if they learned something and were refining the skills of the Vigil (whatever that means to you or your players) then they probably should earn a practical xp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1881-the-cowardly-scion","name":"The Cowardly Scion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1881_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T04:09:38-07:00","id":287441,"title":"","content":"Yes, that's what I'd say as well. If the hunters learned something new in the course of their Vigil, something that relates to their future Vigil and that they wouldn't have an inkling of in their old lives, they should get Practical Experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/186-morty","name":"Morty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar186_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T06:34:56-07:00","id":288489,"title":"","content":"While it does talk about earning practical experience when dealing with monsters, I'd be liberal there. Not all the monsters a hunter might end up hunting aren't human after all: magic users, slashers, and cultists for example are all valid targets of the vigil and are all human as per the hunter core book.<br /> <br /> Magic users can include occultists who just learn rituals anyone can do or learned a spell anyone can learn, and not all cultists or slashers have any supernatural power, so while by RAW a mass murdering drug dealer isn't part of the vigil unless they know some magic,joined a cult, or gained slasher traits, it could easily come across as an arbitrary decision. <br /> <br /> However the core book also points out that vigilantism is rather rare among hunters, some are uncomfortable using their skills on regular humans, others just feel that it's not wise to get involved in cases that cops can handle, or end up investigating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}